er":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18193","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169258","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56647","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234776","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"439531","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"87168","synopsis":"A well-dressed young man staggers into the Chirinuya. Nio, Taro, and Hajime struggle with his demands, but things take a turn for the serious when a swordsman comes for the problem customer's head. Who is this young man, and what makes him a target?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10712448/screencap/675ed172e2b2e.jpg"},{"title":"True Strength","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18193","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169258","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56647","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234776","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"439531","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"87218","synopsis":"Nio's plan sends most of the attackers on a wild goose chase. But the strongest assassin remains, and only a lone boy stands between him and the Shogun. Can Nio outmaneuver an opponent who has him so outmatched?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10712449/screencap/67692d7876500.jpg"},{"title":"Eight Heads","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18193","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169258","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56647","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234776","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"439531","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"87594","synopsis":"Nio risks his life in a desperate bid to buy time for Iemochi's escape, but the Shogun can't bring himself to abandon a child. When all seems lost, Hijikata joins the battle. But can even he defeat the white-clad assassin?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10712450/screencap/6777272d621f4.jpg"},{"title":"Sharing the Same Dream","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18193","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169258","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56647","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234776","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"439531","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"87718","synopsis":"A wounded Nio wakes up in a luxurious sickbed in Nijo Castle. After a night of unsettling experiences, Kikuchiyo makes him a startling offer: leave the Miburo to serve the Shogun directly. Where do Nio's loyalties lie, and what has he learned from his encounter with the Blood Risshidan?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10712451/screencap/677a298fdaca2.jpg"},{"title":"The Race to Raise Money","episodeNumber":14,"sourceEpisodeNumber":14,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18193","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"169258","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"mal","id":"56647","episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"234776","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"439531","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[14]}],"link":"87921","synopsis":"The Miburo set out to earn the small fortune their uniform coats will cost. While they each rack their brains and try their luck, a woman approaches Hijikata,